    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "During a failing Gu refinement, Fang Yuan throws sandpit Gu unactivated into a chosen spot in the fire as a Gu material. The fire burns it into powder, the attractive force drops sharply, and he escapes the blaze. Losing that precious sandpit Gu lowers young Thieving Heaven’s strength even though the body survives. Fang Yuan later summarizes the improvised sequence as sandpit powder consolidating the body before chimney smoke, clear water, and blood finish the work that yields sneak attack Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1500
        ],
