    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan regains control of young Thieving Heaven against desert wolves, the aperture holds only a sandpit Gu, a chimney smoke Gu, and a clear water Gu. He activates sandpit Gu, spending five percent of his green copper primeval essence, and instantly forms a pit in the desert. A pursuing desert wolf steps into it, loses balance, and falls.",
